<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12268" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποβῐβ-άζω</span></b> , causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποβαίνω</span> B, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make to get off,</i> esp. from a ship, <i>disembark, put
				on shore,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.97
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ εἰς τόπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.76
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				511e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὴν πολεμίαν ἀποβιβάζων τὸν πόδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					1163
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινὰ ὅποι αὐτὸς κελεύοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.4.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποβιβάσασθαί τινας ἀπὸ τῶν
				νεῶν</span>
			<i>cause</i> them <i>to be put on shore,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.32
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
